# Memory index

One line per fact, linking its file. belt injects the bullet lines below at
session start (capped at 30 — prune before adding past that); an agent opens
the linked file only when the one-liner isn't enough. Keep facts out of this
file: the index is a table of contents, not the store.

- [Draft-only messaging](draft-only-messaging.md) — never send Slack/email directly; always create drafts
